<title>PHILIPPINES: FDC says 1996 profits jump 344 pct.</title>
<headline>FDC says 1996 profits jump 344 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>	 (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Revenues			    1,074 vs 99.021</p>
<p>    Net income			  4,033 vs 908.916</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Filinvest Development Corp. Based on the statement of income, the company said revenues from its real estate operations surge 177 percent to 5.59 billion pesos last year from 2.023 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
